{"title":"Minggu 10 — TAIDA IV: Action","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Minggu 10 — TAIDA IV: Action","description":"Desire–Action gap, affordability, authority, negotiation, agreement, dan action."},"headingText":"Hasil belajar","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.week-path}\n::: {}\nDesire belum otomatis menjadi tindakan. Minggu ini melatih discovery terhadap barrier, authority, dan affordability, lalu menyusun agreement yang eksplisit dan feasible.\n:::\n::: {tag=\"aside\"}\n**Capaian utama**\n\nMampu mengubah intention menjadi agreement yang menyebut owner, action, waktu, dan review.\n:::\n:::\n\n\n- Memetakan money, time, effort, capability, risk, change, dan authority.\n- Membedakan wish, intention, commitment, agreement, dan action.\n- Menghasilkan micro-agreement ketika full action belum feasible.\n\n## Materi slide\n\n[Buka slide Minggu 10](../slides/minggu-10.html){.slide-link target=\"_blank\"}\n\n## Konsep kunci\n\n`Desire → Barrier → Negotiation → Agreement → Action → Review`\n\nClosing yang etis menghormati “tidak” dan tidak melampaui authority.\n\n## Quiz formatif\n\n<div class=\"quiz\" data-quiz-id=\"week-10\">\n<fieldset data-answer=\"b\"><legend>1. Affordability mencakup …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"a\"> Harga saja.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"b\"> Uang, waktu, effort, capability, risk, dan change.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"c\"> Keinginan communicator.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"a\"><legend>2. Agreement operasional menjelaskan …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"a\"> Owner, action, deadline, dependency, dan review.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"b\"> Bahwa semua orang berniat membantu.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"c\"> Hanya desired outcome.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"c\"><legend>3. Micro-agreement tepat digunakan ketika …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"a\"> Communicator ingin menghindari keputusan.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"b\"> Target sudah menolak dengan jelas.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"c\"> Langkah kecil dapat menghasilkan evidence untuk keputusan berikutnya.</label></fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"quiz-submit\">Periksa jawaban</button><p class=\"quiz-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n</div>\n\n## Evidence pencapaian\n\nSertakan desire evidence, barrier/authority map, opsi, trade-off, agreement, dan action evidence.\n\n[Isi evidence Minggu 10](../portfolio/week-10.qmd){.slide-link}\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.week-path}\n::: {}\nDesire belum otomatis menjadi tindakan. Minggu ini melatih discovery terhadap barrier, authority, dan affordability, lalu menyusun agreement yang eksplisit dan feasible.\n:::\n::: {tag=\"aside\"}\n**Capaian utama**\n\nMampu mengubah intention menjadi agreement yang menyebut owner, action, waktu, dan review.\n:::\n:::\n\n## Hasil belajar\n\n- Memetakan money, time, effort, capability, risk, change, dan authority.\n- Membedakan wish, intention, commitment, agreement, dan action.\n- Menghasilkan micro-agreement ketika full action belum feasible.\n\n## Materi slide\n\n[Buka slide Minggu 10](../slides/minggu-10.html){.slide-link target=\"_blank\"}\n\n## Konsep kunci\n\n`Desire → Barrier → Negotiation → Agreement → Action → Review`\n\nClosing yang etis menghormati “tidak” dan tidak melampaui authority.\n\n## Quiz formatif\n\n<div class=\"quiz\" data-quiz-id=\"week-10\">\n<fieldset data-answer=\"b\"><legend>1. Affordability mencakup …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"a\"> Harga saja.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"b\"> Uang, waktu, effort, capability, risk, dan change.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q1\" value=\"c\"> Keinginan communicator.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"a\"><legend>2. Agreement operasional menjelaskan …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"a\"> Owner, action, deadline, dependency, dan review.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"b\"> Bahwa semua orang berniat membantu.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q2\" value=\"c\"> Hanya desired outcome.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"c\"><legend>3. Micro-agreement tepat digunakan ketika …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"a\"> Communicator ingin menghindari keputusan.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"b\"> Target sudah menolak dengan jelas.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w10q3\" value=\"c\"> Langkah kecil dapat menghasilkan evidence untuk keputusan berikutnya.</label></fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"quiz-submit\">Periksa jawaban</button><p class=\"quiz-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n</div>\n\n## Evidence pencapaian\n\nSertakan desire evidence, barrier/authority map, opsi, trade-off, agreement, dan action evidence.\n\n[Isi evidence Minggu 10](../portfolio/week-10.qmd){.slide-link}\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidt